WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,820
The doctor tells you to rest at home for two days. Company reforms

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:14,730
To re-study and deploy, I have to come over, Secretary Wang.

3
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:16,330
What happened outside

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,330
I don't know either

5
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:18,570
I just listen to what they say

6
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:21,170
It is said that there were several people in front holding guns.

7
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,970
Robbed a bank on Pioneer Road

8
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,090
It is said that two people were killed on the spot.

9
00:00:25,570 --> 00:00:27,090
Bank staff preparing to call the police

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,930
The person who just came over there said yes

11
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:30,610
These robbers were chased by the Sheriff

12
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:32,450
Escaped to a university over Xianfeng Road

13
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:34,290
It seems like they are taking hostages or something.

14
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:37,650
Anyway, it was said that the Sheriff had surrounded it. Didn’t you know that just now?

15
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,650
How many police cars have there been, Sheriffs and stuff like that?

16
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:42,690
It seems like a fully armed university

17
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,530
Pioneer Road seems not too far from here, right?

18
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:46,890
Just turn a corner and you'll be there.

19
00:00:47,330 --> 00:01:05,140
Okay, I understand. Thank you. Go ahead and do your work. I'm going to go nearby. Mr. Zhang needs to go out and make a call immediately. Don't let strangers in. Okay.
